"macOS denied Screen Recording / System Audio capture permission (TCC).\n\nSteps to fix (required for ad-hoc signed apps):\n  1) Open System Settings -> Privacy & Security -> Screen & System Audio Recording\n  2) Select \"{0}\" in the list, click the \"-\" button to REMOVE it\n  3) Fully quit \"{0}\" (Cmd+Q)\n  4) Relaunch \"{0}\", trigger System Output again, and click Allow\n\nDo NOT just toggle the switch: the stale TCC record must be deleted first." = "无法采集系统输出音频：\nmacOS 拒绝了本 App 的“屏幕与系统音频录制”权限 (TCC)。\n\n请按以下步骤操作（这是 macOS 对 ad-hoc 签名 App 的限制）：\n  1) 打开 系统设置 -> 隐私与安全性 -> 屏幕与系统音频录制\n  2) 在列表里找到“{0}”，点右下角的“-”把它移除\n  3) 完全退出“{0}”（Cmd+Q）\n  4) 重新打开“{0}”，再次选择系统输出，弹出授权时点“允许”\n\n请勿只切换开关 —— 升级后旧的授权记录已失效，必须先移除、再重新添加，权限才会真正生效。"
"Desktop audio capture requires macOS 13.0 or newer." = "桌面音频采集需要 macOS 13.0 或更高版本。"
"Mac desktop audio capture is only supported on macOS." = "Mac 桌面音频采集仅支持 macOS。"
"Timed out while starting ScreenCaptureKit stream." = "启动 ScreenCaptureKit 流超时。"
