"Inter-sample peak (4x oversampled). LED bars show L and R, readouts show the louder one." = "采样点间峰值（4 倍过采样）。灯条显示左右两路，读数显示较大的一路。"
"Average level of the left and right channel. Readouts show the louder one." = "左右声道的平均电平。读数显示较大的一路。"
"LED bars: pixel meters with a dB scale. Number readouts: big numbers with a progress bar." = "灯条：带 dB 刻度的像素电平柱。数字读数：大数字加进度条。"
"Peak bars" = "峰值柱"
