"DR readout style" = "DR 读数样式"
"Big digits" = "大数字"
"Bars + digits" = "进度条 + 数字"
"History span" = "历史跨度"
"Sample-peak level bars for the left and right channel, with a slowly falling hold line." = "左右声道的采样峰值电平柱，带缓慢回落的保持线。"
"Average (RMS) level bars for the left and right channel." = "左右声道的平均 (RMS) 电平柱。"
"Dynamic range of the recent programme: loudest 20% against the average." = "近期节目的动态范围：最响的 20% 与平均值之比。"
"Dynamic range over the whole programme. Resets after a long silence." = "整段节目的动态范围。长时间静音后复位。"
"Peak minus RMS in dB right now. Low = squashed, high = punchy." = "当前峰值减 RMS（dB）。低 = 被压缩，高 = 有冲击力。"
"Scrolling graph of the crest factor over time." = "峰值因数随时间滚动的曲线。"
"Big digits: large numbers that fill the cell. Bars + digits: smaller numbers with a progress bar." = "大数字：填满格子的大号数字。进度条 + 数字：较小的数字加进度条。"
"How much time the crest history graph covers." = "峰值因数历史曲线覆盖的时间长度。"
"Goniometer" = "相位图"
"Correlation dial" = "相关度表盘"
"Width bar" = "宽度条"
"Balance bar" = "平衡条"
