"Bar style" = "条形样式"
"Trace" = "轨迹"
"Segmented" = "像素格"
"Solid" = "实心"
"Left against right as a mid/side vector scope. A tall thin shape is mono, a wide cloud is stereo." = "以中/侧矢量示波显示左对右。又高又细 = 单声道，宽云团 = 立体声。"
"+1 = mono-safe, 0 = very wide, -1 = out of phase. A needle below 0 means parts cancel in mono." = "+1 = 单声道安全，0 = 很宽，-1 = 反相。指针低于 0 表示转单声道时部分内容会抵消。"
"How much of the signal lives in the side channel, 0 - 100%." = "信号中位于侧声道的比例，0 - 100%。"
"Left / right level balance. C = centred." = "左右电平平衡。C = 居中。"
"Dots: each sample is a pixel. Trace: neighbouring samples are joined by a thin line." = "点阵：每个采样一个像素。轨迹：相邻采样用细线连接。"
"Segmented: pixel cells. Solid: one continuous filled bar." = "像素格：分格显示。实心：一条连续填充的条。"
"Display type" = "显示类型"
"Waveform" = "波形"
"Channels" = "声道"
"Classic" = "经典"
"Colour by frequency" = "按频率染色"
"Low / mid split" = "低 / 中 分频点"
"Mid / high split" = "中 / 高 分频点"
"Auto zoom" = "自动缩放"
"Level rings" = "电平环"
"Waveform: signal against time. X-Y: left against right. Lissajous: the same turned 45 degrees (mid / side)." = "波形：信号随时间变化。X-Y：左对右。李萨如：旋转 45 度（中 / 侧）。"
"Which channel traces to draw." = "绘制哪个声道的波形。"
"Audio is split into three bands and each band's dots are drawn in its own colour: red for lows, purple-blue for mids, cyan for highs." = "音频拆成低 / 中 / 高三路，各自的点画成独立颜色：低频红、中频蓝紫、高频青。"
"Low band: below this frequency (red dot cloud)." = "低频道：低于此频率（红色点云）。"
"High band: above this frequency (cyan dot cloud)." = "高频道：高于此频率（青色点云）。"
"Scales the picture so the loudest point stays inside the screen." = "自动缩放画面，使最大的点始终留在屏幕内。"
"Concentric rings with dB labels behind the dots." = "点后面带 dB 标注的同心圆环。"
"Dial style" = "表盘样式"
"Needle style" = "指针样式"
"Signal LED" = "信号灯"
"Minimal" = "极简"
"Wedge" = "锥形"
"Stereo L/R" = "立体声 L/R"
"Half circle" = "半圆"
"Vintage fan" = "复古扇形"
"Bar scale" = "横向刻度条"
"LED ladder" = "LED 梯柱"
"Mirror" = "镜像刻度"
"Half circle: the classic pink semicircle. Vintage fan: a narrow fan-shaped window with a thick arc rail, a thin percent scale inside, a long thin needle and a red zone past 0 dB. Bar scale: a green-yellow-red bar with slanted ticks above, percent dots below and a slider riding on it. LED ladder: a row of LED columns that step up in height and light up with the level. Minimal: a big number over a hairline scale with a small cursor. Mirror: the dB scale runs along the middle with a fill bar above and a mirrored one below." = "半圆：经典粉色半圆表盘。复古扇形：窄开口的小扇形表窗，粗弧轨 + 内侧细百分比副刻度，细长指针，0 dB 之后整段转红。横向刻度条：绿-黄-红分段横杆，上排斜刻度、下排百分比圆点，游标骑在横杆上。LED 梯柱：一排逐格加高的 LED 柱，随电平点亮。极简：大号数字 + 一根发丝刻度线和小游标。镜像刻度：dB 刻度走中线，上下各一条对称的填充条。"
"Thin line" = "细线"
"Thin line: thin needle. Wedge: tapered needle. Stereo L/R: two thin needles, one per channel. On the bar-type dials it changes the indicator: Thin line = hairline cursor or slim LEDs, Wedge = filled bar or solid wedge with a big arrow, Stereo L/R = separate L and R tracks." = "细线：细指针。锥形：渐细的指针。立体声 L/R：左右各一根细指针。横向类表盘里改变指示器形态：细线 = 发丝游标 / 细针 LED，锥形 = 填充条或实心楔形 + 大箭头，立体声 L/R = L、R 各走一条独立轨道。"
"Round lamp in the corner: dark = no signal, green = signal, red = at or above 0 dBFS." = "角落的圆形指示灯：暗 = 无信号，绿 = 有信号，红 = 达到或超过 0 dBFS。"
"Curve" = "曲线"
"Mid" = "中间"
"Mid + Side" = "中间 + 侧边"
"Left + Right" = "左 + 右"
"FFT scale" = "FFT 刻度"
"Log" = "对数"
"Mel" = "梅尔"
"Linear" = "线性"
"Smooth: 256 columns with blur - calm. Semi: one point per FFT bin with a spline. Raw: one point per bin joined by straight lines - maximum spike detail." = "平滑：256 列并模糊，平静。半平滑：每个 FFT 频点一个点，样条连接。原始：每个频点一个点，直线连接，保留最多尖峰细节。"
"Mid: (L+R)/2, what a mono speaker hears. Mid + Side: solid mid, faint side (L-R)/2. Left + Right: solid left, faint right." = "中间：(L+R)/2，即单声道喇叭听到的内容。中间 + 侧边：实线为中间，淡线为侧边 (L-R)/2。左 + 右：实线为左，淡线为右。"
"How frequency is laid out left to right. Log: every octave is equally wide. Mel: follows pitch perception. Linear: equal Hz per pixel, so highs get most of the room." = "频率从左到右的排布方式。对数：每个八度等宽。梅尔：贴近音高感知。线性：每像素等 Hz，高频占据大部分空间。"
"Scroll direction" = "滚动方向"
"Leftwards" = "向左"
"Rightwards" = "向右"
"Upwards" = "向上"
"Downwards" = "向下"
"Sharpening" = "锐化"
"Slope" = "斜率"
"Tilts the curve up towards the highs, 1 kHz is the pivot. 4.5 dB/oct (default) makes pink noise look flat; 0 turns the tilt off and shows the raw level." = "让曲线越往高频越抬起，支点在 1 kHz。4.5 dB/oct（默认）下粉噪看起来接近平直；0 = 关闭倾斜，显示原始电平。"
"Sharper" = "更锐利"
"Theme" = "主题"
"Heat" = "热力"
"Grey" = "灰度"
"Ice" = "冰蓝"
"Which way the picture moves. Leftwards: new sound enters on the right (classic). Upwards and Downwards turn the picture so time runs vertically and frequency runs left to right." = "画面移动的方向。向左：新声音从右侧进入（经典）。向上 / 向下：时间纵向、频率横向（低频在左）。"
"Scroll speed in pixels per second. Slower keeps a longer history on screen." = "滚动速度（像素/秒）。越慢，屏幕上保留的历史越长。"
"Classic: raw FFT magnitude. Sharp: frequency reassignment - thinner, clearer note lines. Sharper: Sharp plus tighter transients." = "经典：原始 FFT 幅度。锐利：频率重分配，音符线更细更清晰。更锐利：在锐利基础上让瞬态更紧凑。"
"Theme follows the current colour theme. Heat runs black - red - yellow - white. Grey is black to white. Ice runs dark blue to white." = "主题跟随当前配色主题。热力：黑 - 红 - 黄 - 白。灰度：黑到白。冰蓝：深蓝到白。"
"How frequency is laid out along the frequency axis. Log gives every octave equal room, Mel follows pitch perception, Linear gives equal Hz per pixel." = "频率轴上的频率排布方式。对数：每个八度等宽；梅尔：贴近音高感知；线性：每像素等 Hz。"
"Back-right" = "右后方"
"Back-left" = "左后方"
"Depth direction" = "深度方向"
"Theme follows the current colour theme. Heat is the classic blue-to-red map. Grey is black to white. Ice runs dark blue to white." = "主题跟随当前配色主题。热力是经典的蓝到红。灰度：黑到白。冰蓝：深蓝到白。"
"Which way older slices recede. Back-right is the classic view; Back-left mirrors the landscape." = "较旧的切片向哪边退远。右后方是经典视角；左后方是镜像。"
"How fast the landscape rolls back. Slower keeps a longer history." = "地形向后滚动的速度。越慢，保留的历史越长。"
"Colour by" = "着色依据"
"Pitch" = "音高"
"Sibilance" = "齿音"
"Sibilance threshold" = "齿音识别阈值"
"Dual channel" = "双声道"
"Pitch: hue follows the musical note. Loudness: colour ramps with level (dBFS). Sibilance: highlights 's' sounds (5 - 12 kHz)." = "音高：色相跟随音符。响度：颜色随电平 (dBFS) 渐变。齿音：高亮“s”音（5 - 12 kHz）。"
"How loud the 5 - 12 kHz band must be before it counts as sibilance. Lower catches fainter 's' sounds, higher keeps only strong ones." = "5 - 12 kHz 频段要多响才算齿音。越低越能捕捉轻微的“s”音，越高只保留强烈的。"
"Scroll speed in pixels per second. Faster shows more detail, slower shows a longer history." = "滚动速度（像素/秒）。越快细节越多，越慢历史越长。"
"Draw the left and right channel as two separate waveforms, left on top and right below." = "把左右声道画成上下两条独立的波形（上 L / 下 R）。"
"Dot size" = "点大小"
"Fade speed" = "消失速度"
"Side length of each dot." = "每个点的边长。"
"How fast old dots disappear. 1.0 is the classic trail; higher is shorter, lower leaves long tails." = "旧点消失的快慢。1.0 是经典拖尾；越大越短，越小拖尾越长。"
"Pan" = "声像"
"Mono check" = "单声道检查"
"Map mode" = "模式"
"Pan: where each frequency band sits in the stereo field - up = left, middle = centre, down = right. Mono check: how much of each band survives when summed to mono - top is safe, bottom is heavy cancellation." = "声像：每个频段在立体声场中的位置，上 = 左，中 = 中央，下 = 右。单声道检查：转成单声道后各频段保留多少，顶部安全，底部抵消严重。"
"How frequency is laid out left to right. Log gives every octave equal room, Mel follows pitch perception, Linear gives equal Hz per pixel." = "频率从左到右的排布方式。对数：每个八度等宽；梅尔：贴近音高感知；线性：每像素等 Hz。"

